<title>USA: U.S. weekly railcar loadings - wk ended Nov 23 - AAR.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly railcar loadings - wk ended Nov 23 - AAR.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Association of American Railroads reported weekly railcar loadings as follows:</p>
<p>    -		Pct Change   Week Ending:	   Year-Ago</p>
<p>    -		   In Week---11/23/96  11/16/96     Week</p>
<p> Grain		   -11.0	26,440    29,692    21,481</p>
<p> Grain Mill Products   1.1	10,073     9,963     8,433</p>
<p> Other Farm Products   7.6	 2,359     2,193     2,278</p>
<p> Metallic Ores	  -5.5	17,445    18,458    17,675</p>
